      "writtenOn": "2019-12-03T22:07:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately, we can not just add the capability callback here, since this is mapped to a phoneId and not a subId.\n\nThis can lead to a bunch of bugs, such as the subscription associated with the phoneId changing, causing the user to not be able to unregister a callback (because the callback is now associated with a different subId) or the subId being removed and the callback never being unregistered with the service.\n\nIn MmTelFeatureConnection, this was handled with a Callback manager, which would listen for subscription changes and automatically unregister callbacks associated with a phone when the subId associated changes.\n\nPerhaps instead, we can abstract CallbackAdapterManager into FeatureConnection and have RcsFeatureConnection implement a CallbackAdapterManger for CallbackAdapterManager?",
